{# Thread ANCHOR (root) for a watched issue — the topic's title in Element.
   Deliberately minimal: the flag + issue number + title become the thread's name.
   The full card (description/due/assignee/labels) is posted as the FIRST message
   INSIDE the thread (issue_card), so a topic renders immediately on creation with
   the card as its first message. Created ONCE per (issue, room). #}
🚩 <a href="{{ url | safe_url }}">#{{ iid }}</a> <b>{{ title | truncate(140, true, '…', 0) }}</b>
